# Local secrets and credentials (never commit)
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.development
**/.env.test
**/.env.production
**/.dev.vars
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*credentials*
**/*secret*

# Dependencies and generated build output
**/node_modules/
**/.next/
**/out/
**/build/
**/.pnpm-store/
**/.vercel/
**/.wrangler/
**/.open-next/

# Local databases and debug output
**/*.db
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite3
**/*debug*
**/npm-debug.log*
**/yarn-debug.log*
**/yarn-error.log*
**/.pnpm-debug.log*

# OS/editor noise
**/.DS_Store
**/*.swp
**/*.swo
